        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "These repository examples run in the embedded playground with editable TypeScript, a live preview, an authored walkthrough, suggested experiments, detected requirements and related APIs. Entries that support other scenes instead of exporting a Scene are shown as source modules without a play control."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "For a smaller scene with one learning goal, start with [Focused scene examples](/focused-examples)."
        }
